# split stop codon on the - strand. CDS [500,630) sits in three coding pieces of
# 30 + 28 + 2 bp (60 bp, 20 codons); the lowest piece holds only 2 of the 3 stop
# bases and the third is the bottom base of the middle piece (genomic 570). 0.0.16
# truncates the codon to the 2-base piece [500,502); gtf22 emits two codon rows
# ([570,571) and [500,502)).
chrS	500	700	txSplit	0	-	500	630	0,0,0	3	2,28,30	0,70,100
